  "solution": "Question given, 57 + 4 × 17 – 11 ÷ 19 = 44\n\n**Option 1:** 4 and 57, + and ÷\n\n= 4 ÷ 57 × 17 – 11 + 19\n\n= 0.07 × 17 – 11 + 19\n\n= 1.19 – 11 + 19\n\n= 9.19 ≠ 44\n\n**Option 2:** 57 and 11, + and ×\n\n= 11 × 5 + 17 - 57 ÷ 19\n\n= 55 + 17 - 3\n\n= 69 ≠ 44\n\n**Option 3:** 4 and 19, + and -\n\n= 57 - 19 × 17 + 11 ÷ 4\n\n= 57 - 323 + 2.75\n\n= -263.25 ≠ 44\n\n**Option 4: 4 and 19, + and ÷**\n\n**= 57 ÷ 19 × 17 – 11 + 4**\n\n**= 3 × 17 – 11 + 4**\n\n**= 51 - 11 + 4 **\n\n**= 44**\n\nHence, the correct answer** \"4 and 19, + and ÷\" **",
